OL,3,GNEWSACrews to leave nature reserve
OL,4,Aafter month-long fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FFirefighters tackling a major blaze at
OL,7,Fa Cambridgeshire nature reserve have
OL,8,Fconfirmed they are ready to leave the
OL,9,Fsite after 31 days.
OL,11,FThe fire at Holme Fen, near
OL,12,FPeterborough, which started on 8
OL,13,FAugust, has left about half the reserve
OL,14,Fbadly burnt. At its peak, more than 100
OL,15,Ffirefighters were deployed to the site.
OL,17,FCambridgeshire Fire and Rescue Service
OL,18,Fwas supported by National Resilience
OL,19,Fcrews providing specialist capabilities
OL,20,Fto tackle the peatland fire.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
