OL,3,GNEWSACrews to leave nature reserve
OL,4,Aafter month-long fire
OL,5,
OL,6,FAssistant chief fire officer Stuart
OL,7,FSmith described it as "the biggest
OL,8,Fincident the county had faced in many
OL,9,Fyears", but said the service could now
OL,10,F"withdraw crews and hand the site back
OL,11,Fto Natural England".
